ur user pic is ogre-like, your pitch in my mind is closer to <b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/UtBysnK0CQM\" target=\"_blank\">this one.</a></b> (1:30 to 1:50)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T09:42:55-07:00","id":886351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=886215#post886215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a> has this witty and intellectual tone, especially when they are theory-crafting or homebrewing. I often imagine them adjusting their glasses and scratching their chin in a pensive or analytical way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm flattered - and I'll have you know that I have a luxurious beard that I sometimes stroke when I'm thinking.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://clyp.it/4kplx0mr\" target=\"_blank\">Let me give you a voice to match to the text</a> - it's a bit more nasal than it should be, but that's just my crappy laptop mic.<br /> <br /> For extra fun, guess my accent! <hr /><br /> For my part, I read faster than most people can speak, and I tend to skim for salient points. If I'm not focusing on the details of what people are saying (i.e., I'm just trying to catch up with the thread), I can cover about a page of intense wall-of-text discussion in a minute or two.<br /> <br /> Which is a fancy way of saying &quot;Oh, wait, I was supposed to assign you people <i>voices</i>? What's next, you're gonna want <i>faces</i> and other fancy stuff like that?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":1170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","user":"amechra","date":". 05-09-2016, 12:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T10:48:20-07:00","id":886432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=886318#post886318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I didn't say high-pitched. Considering that your user pic is ogre-like, your pitch in my mind is closer to <b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/UtBysnK0CQM\" target=\"_blank\">this one.</a></b> (1:30 to 1:50)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, I'm saying my voice is higher pitched. And the pic is supposed to be a Nosferatu. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T14:01:51-07:00","id":887475,"title":"","content":"Hah I did a sound clip for ya. <a href=\"https://clyp.it/vcy5axlo\" target=\"_blank\">https://clyp.it/vcy5axlo</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Is it what y'all thought or way off?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T15:21:44-07:00","id":887547,"title":"","content":"Not exactly the same, but I mean just talking slivers of difference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u2