Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T23:50:13-07:00","id":887945,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=amechra;n886351]<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://clyp.it/4kplx0mr\" target=\"_blank\">Let me give you a voice to match to the text</a> - it's a bit more nasal than it should be, but that's just my crappy laptop mic.<br /> <br /> For extra fun, guess my accent! <hr /><br /> <br /> Where the hell are you from?! You have an accent that sounds perhaps midwestern american, with a HINT of british. Though is it odd I really fucking like your voice its so chill and makes that shit you are describing not mindnumbingly boring.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T03:24:21-07:00","id":888016,"title":"","content":"So, <a href=\"https://clyp.it/gglcp330#\" target=\"_blank\">here is my voice</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T15:16:05-07:00","id":888603,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a>: I am not good at identifying accents, but I agree with Scelesta. You do sound a bit British.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar897_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"897\" data-vbnamecard=\"897\">Scelesta</a>: I have read only a few of your posts, so my headcanon voice for you wasn't very well defined. That being said, it wasn't far off from what I expected.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a>: The volume of your voice clip is very low on my computer. I can hear a lisp, which I wasn't expecting. Your user pic made me imagine a more rumbling or maybe raspy voice.<br /> <br /> I decided to post <a href=\"https://clyp.it/t2l3gisd\" target=\"_blank\"><b>my voice</b></a> as well. How does it measure up against your expectations? I am very curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T15:28:37-07:00","id":888613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=888603#post888603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I decided to post <a href=\"https://clyp.it/t2l3gisd\" target=\"_blank\"><b>my voice</b></a> as well. How does it measure up against your expectations? I am very curious.</div> </div> </div> </div>A lot more bold and... thrumby... not a word, but it's kinda what comes to mind when I hear it. Like there's almost a powerful deep... not warbling, and not throbbing, but like kinda like that with a bit of a &quot;thump&quot; like of a drum. Feels very much like a speechgiver voice. Someone who can talk normally and be heard by a crowd without amplification.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T15:42:38-07:00","id":888624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=888613#post888613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A lot more bold and... thrumby... not a word, but it's kinda what comes to mind when I hear it. Like there's almost a powerful deep... not warbling, and not throbbing, but like kinda like that with a bit of a &quot;thump&quot; like of a drum. Feels very much like a speechgiver voice. Someone who can talk normally and be heard by a crowd without amplification.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you! I had to try about 10 times to get it right. My voice depends quite a bit on my emotional state, but I have been trying to keep it like the clip. Were you thinking of radio hosts, by any chance?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T16:49:15-07:00","id":888650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=888624#post888624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Thank you! I had to try about 10 times to get it right. My voice depends quite a bit on my emotional state, but I have been trying to keep it like the clip. Were you thinking of radio hosts, by any chance?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, since most I've heard aren't really that memorable for voices. If that makes sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T00:07:43-07:00","id":889716,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Scelesta;n887945]<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=886351#post886351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where the hell are you from?! You have an accent that sounds perhaps midwestern american, with a HINT of british. Though is it odd I really fucking like your voice its so chill and makes that shit you are describing not mindnumbingly boring.</div> </div> </div> </div>That'd be an upstate New York accent (with some stuff mixed in - I've been told I have a very faint German accent, for example).<br /> <br /> And thanks for the compliment - I've practiced my public reading quite a bit (I've been thinking of doing some books on, well, not <i>tape</i> exactly...)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4443_5.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4443\" data-vbnamecard=\"4443\">GibberingEloquence</a> Judging from the accent, I <i>want</i> to say Finland? Your pronunciation isn't bad - I've heard <i>much, much</i> worse.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar897_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"897\" data-vbnamecard=\"897\">Scelesta</a> That's a nicely rounded voice you've got there - it's definitely a voice where I can imagine swears slipping in from all kinds of corners.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a> You sound like you come from northern Germany - don't worry about the pronunciation too much. What languages do you speak other than English, if I may ask?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T01:16:19-07:00","id":889733,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a> its the pacific northwest &quot;Accent&quot; though appearntly if i'm not paying attention i accidently mimic accents i hear around me ending up with a very different voice that people ask me where i'm from its funny telling them i'm born and raised in washington state never been to any state other then oregon my entire life, parents also born and raised here so no accent from them haha and yes LOTS of swearing comes from my mouth, I dont have to even be mad, i use fuck as a noun, verb etc hah<br /> <br /> Also new york really!? I'm not crazy familar with east coast accents so i just figured new york was far different from that. You have that &quot;newscaster&quot; voice i think of when i think of the midwest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T02:15:02-07:00","id":889753,"title":"","content":"I speak Spanish, Galician, English and German","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T02:30:39-07:00","id":889754,"title":"","content":"I feel a bit bad that I'm not comfortable with my voice to be recording it generally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T03:24:09-07:00","id":889771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=889753#post889753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I speak Spanish, Galician, English and German</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a> Dude record something in Galician and German and spanish for us! I've never heard Galician before, and I'm curious as well as what your german sounds like hehe","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T03:28:38-07:00","id":889774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=889754#post889754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel a bit bad that I'm not comfortable with my voice to be recording it generally.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar378_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"378\" data-vbnamecard=\"378\">haren</a> Dont feel bad! I'm not comfortable with my voice either, I dont speak much in public cause I am.LOUD. I was a nervous as fuck to record my voice, in fact it took a few attempts, and a good bit of me sitting on the link to decide to even post it. Its totally okay to not post a voice clip i say do what you are comfortable doing, you dont have to do something just cause others are!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T04:04:54-07:00","id":889786,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar897_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"897\" data-vbnamecard=\"897\">Scelesta</a> Yeah, I get that. I might try and push through and share if people really want to know. But it'll take a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T11:20:27-07:00","id":890033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=889716#post889716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4443_5.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4443\" data-vbnamecard=\"4443\">GibberingEloquence</a> Judging from the accent, I <i>want</i> to say Finland? Your pronunciation isn't bad - I've heard <i>much, much</i> worse.</div> </div> </div> </div> Nope. I'm from Brazil. My accent is <b><a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carioca\" target=\"_blank\">Carioca</a></b>. I'm glad to know my pronunciation is ok despite the lack of practice. I have no idea why you said Finland, though. I know that quite a few famous bands are Finnish, such as Nightwish and Poets Of The Fall. Perhaps I reminded you of one?<br /> <br /> I'd listen to any audio books you recorded. For some reason, I think your voice would be great for Dr. Seuss stories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T12:51:26-07:00","id":890103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=889733#post889733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1170_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1170\" data-vbnamecard=\"1170\">amechra</a> its the pacific northwest &quot;Accent&quot; though appearntly if i'm not paying attention i accidently mimic accents i hear around me ending up with a very different voice that people ask me where i'm from its funny telling them i'm born and raised in washington state never been to any state other then oregon my entire life, parents also born and raised here so no accent from them haha and yes LOTS of swearing comes from my mouth, I dont have to even be mad, i use fuck as a noun, verb etc hah<br /> <br /> Also new york really!? I'm not crazy familar with east coast accents so i just figured new york was far different from that. You have that &quot;newscaster&quot; voice i think of when i think of the midwest.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do the accent mimicry too - I develop a bit of a Yorkshire accent when I'm talking to my sister, who happens to be living over there. And we mustn't forget - fuck is <i>every</i> part of speech other than a preposition (unless fuckwards is a word now).<br /> <br /> And yeah - it's an upstate New York accent. You're probably thinking of a New York City accent - people tend to forget that there's other parts of the State. Some examples of people from the area would be <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q-2ZYy4_dlw\" target=\"_blank\">Stephanie Courtney</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yu8QfIC5fhI\" target=\"_blank\">David Sedaris</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZpKkHCVbSyw\" target=\"_blank\">Rod Serling</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=890033#post890033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Nope. I'm from Brazil. My accent is <b><a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carioca\" target=\"_blank\">Carioca</a></b>. I'm glad to know my pronunciation is ok despite the lack of practice. I have no idea why you said Finland, though. I know that quite a few famous bands are Finnish, such as Nightwish and Poets Of The Fall. Perhaps I reminded you of one?<br /> <br /> I'd listen to any audio books you recorded. For some reason, I think your voice would be great for Dr. Seuss stories.</div> </div> </div> </div>You sound kind of like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/Crowley9/featured\" target=\"_blank\">Crowley9</a>, who is Finnish. I confess that I'm... not exactly familiar with Brazilian accents.<br /> <br /> As for you, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a>... I'd adore hearing something in Gallego. I might scrape the rust off my Spanish and give that a recording.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar378_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"378\" data-vbnamecard=\"378\">haren</a>... sorry if you feel pressured - no one expects you to step out of your comfort zone for our sakes.<br /> <hr /><br /> I tried to record something a bit more <a href=\"https://clyp.it/cgtvtuyg\" target=\"_blank\">emotional</a> - I'm out of practice pronouncing Poe, so it's up to the jury whether or not its any <i>good</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T16:13:39-07:00","id":890224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=890103#post890103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You sound kind of like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/Crowley9/featured\" target=\"_blank\">Crowley9</a>, who is Finnish. I confess that I'm... not exactly familiar with Brazilian accents.<br /> <br /> I tried to record something a bit more <a href=\"https://clyp.it/cgtvtuyg\" target=\"_blank\">emotional</a> - I'm out of practice pronouncing Poe, so it's up to the jury whether or not its any <i>good</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div> Crowley9's voice is a lot more gravelly than mine. And your reading of the The Bells wasn't bad at all. I just thought you were a little too fast, especially when you read the repeated words.<br /> <br /> If anyone is interested, I can try to record myself reading a poem. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T21:55:29-07:00","id":890415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=885285#post885285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I'm vaguely curious if anyone has those about me. Let's see... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar380_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"380\" data-vbnamecard=\"380\">AzraelFirestorm</a> kinda has... kinda imagine a &quot;Fire and Brimstone&quot; preacher, but you know, not talking about those. Scelesta[/USER] I feel has a sort of... sing-song, childish aspect (I don't mean this as an insult). There's a kind of energy, kindness, and sense of innocent decency to it. Sorry I'm not quite sure on anyone else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only when I'm pretending to be southern, a la the leader of the Ninth Circle cult from VtM Bloodlines. Usually I sound like a cross between a radio DJ and that one uncle that was once a liberal arts major and is now a crazy conspiracy theorist drunk.<br /> <br /> You've got Scelesta down pretty accurately, though. She's a musical thing, that Exalt.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T04:25:52-07:00","id":890539,"title":"","content":"Thanks AzraelFirestorm! I appreciate that, especially someone with a good taste in Kickstarters and Willy Wonka quotes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Myself, I probably back kickstarters too much. Like right now, I'm backing what are effectively Dwarven Towers. &gt;_&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T08:25:07-07:00","id":890577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/879121-do-you-have-specific-voices-in-your-mind-for-other-users?p=890415#post890415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Only when I'm pretending to be southern, a la the leader of the Ninth Circle cult from VtM Bloodlines. Usually I sound like a cross between a radio DJ and that one uncle that was once a liberal arts major and is now a crazy conspiracy theorist drunk.<br /> <br /> You've got Scelesta down pretty accurately, though. She's a musical thing, that Exalt.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> lol Az, I wouldnt say a drunk conspiracy theorist! But yes radio DJ is pretty damn accurate.Empassioned would also fit well. (Yes that is a tone of fucking speech!) also I miss your voice, we really need to fucking have a phone call again eventually, I will give up my afternoon nap for that shit! <br /> <br /> hah you've heard my voice enough to know that! But man if you knew how much of my day i spent singing you'd be shocked, which probably is why my voice is so singsongy. I spend a good majority of my waking time singing, be it along to songs I enjoy, making up songs to sing while doing shit, making up STUPID AS SHIT songs to sing to baby, or singing nursery ryhmes cause T_T ALL DAY THEY ARE PLAYING ON MY TV. At this point I actually caught myself in the store the other day singing a fucking nursery ryhm while shopping and the baby wasnt even with me at the time. I didnt even know i was doing it. I must have looked fucking crazy. i like singing, also took choir as a kid up till 9th grade so that likely influenced my voice as well.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-18T00:01:14-07:00","id":893087,"title":"","content":"I have adorable friends.<br /> <br /> Impassioned* is one way to categorize my weird, rambling enthusiasm for ideas both contrarion and absurd, along with my propensity to sling dick like my species is going extinct. My people's mating dance is both highly technical and almost exclusively fueled by hallucinogenic cacti. Priorities form differently, is what I'm saying. <br /> <br /> <br /> *Hey, you spell stuff however you want, toots. The English language is a malleable and strange creature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-18T01:08:16-07:00","id":893122,"title":"","content":"I sound like a wise old man talking only through a xylophone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 06-16-2016, 05:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","tit